uld this be  hinting at a possible future story where  magneto is the father of the scarlet  witch in the actual mcu i'm not sure but  i really really hope so and of course  last but definitely not least  ghostwriter was supposed to be a part of  the illuminati now nothing has been said  about who the actor was supposed to be  to play ghost rider but since this  report says that the scenes were shot  that means that there was indeed an  actor playing ghost rider it's not like  this was an idea but they never shot it  they actually shot this now i'm kind of  okay with them not including all of  these cameos because they're all gonna  die that's what james clement states in  his podcast that these characters were  all going to die they were going to join  the other members of the illuminati and  fight and lose to wanda and yeah i would  have loved to see that but i'd like a  permanent ghost rider in the mcu i'd  like a permanent magneto and other x-men  and deadpool and if they found a really  perfect actor to play one of these roles  i'd like to be surprised down the road  now don't get me wrong i really really  really want john krasinski to play mr  fantastic in the main mcu i think he  looked absolutely perfect as mr  fantastic and i think of course his  acting was on point this is something  that i think needs to happen after all  in multiverse of madness they  established that some variants can look  exactly the same all of the doctor  strange variants look the same and the  wanda variant looked the same as well so  fingers crossed that our earth 616 mr  fantastic looks just like john krasinski  so he can play that role and of course i  would absolutely love for his wife to  play sue storm as well but in the  meantime let me know what you think  about these cut scenes would you have  liked to have seen these which i'm  assuming the answer is yes but let me  know how you feel about this in the  comments down below don't forget to like  the video and subscribe so y